ent directly behind  us  and they've lived at the apartments  together for a couple years and the 911  no the shooter who's the father he's the  person who actually called  to report the incident and have you  talked to any neighbors  so right now we are in the process of  speaking with a couple neighbors  is trying to locate anyone who may have  heard anything and that's why i urge  anybody who has any of those details to  call  at this point we have not located anyone  yet who heard the gunfire  uh you gave us the age of the shooter  you did not give us the age of the  daughter  i did she's a white female in her late  20s yes  all right do you know how long they've  lived here how long they've been living  in the same apartment  i believe they've lived here for a  couple years together all right  thank you guys appreciate it
 

